  captionLineHeight "… Zeilenhöhe --line-height", sidebar header "Seitenpanel-Kopf",
  timeline tool "Zeitstrahl"; page 1440/1440 horizontalOverflow=false; no window/console errors
reload with DE stored: lang=de, DE aria-pressed=true (localStorage.preview-locale persists)
fallback A — German applied, en.json blocked, click EN:
  lang=de, switch DE=true EN=false, page stays German, no errors (toggle never flips alone)
