## Notes

- German copy lives only in `locales/de.json`; `language-check` scans `.html`/`.css`/`.js` and is
  green, and the JSON is outside its scan roots by design.
- `localStorage` unavailable (private mode) or a missing locale file keeps the page on the language
  that is really applied; the switch still works for the session and logs no errors.
- Chrome for Testing requests `/favicon.ico`; that is the only server-log 404 and not a preview
  resource.
